      "en": "RAYMOND (Scene 33, turn 321): Night falls quickly in this wartime winter, Sabine. The fog is rising from the ponds and will soon bury everything. We experience thus the significance of vigilant fidelity that maintains the presence of hope at the heart of historical adversity."
